      ],
      "title": "Dysregulation of innate and adaptive serum mediators precedes systemic lupus erythematosus classification and improves prognostic accuracy of autoantibodies",
      "content": "Dysregulation of innate and adaptive serum mediators precedes systemic lupus erythematosus classification and improves prognostic accuracy of autoantibodies\n\nJournal of Autoimmunity 74 (2016) 182-193. Longitudinal study of 84 pre-SLE individuals and 86 matched controls from the Department of Defense Serum Repository measuring autoantibodies and 32 soluble mediators.",
      "created": "2026-11-06T16:43:35.762Z",
      "modified": "2026-11-06T16:43:35.762Z",
      "creator": [
        "x:author-0",
