      ],
      "title": "Determine the cellular sources of dysregulated soluble mediators in preclinical SLE.",
      "content": "Determine the cellular sources of dysregulated soluble mediators in preclinical SLE.\n\nThe discussion explicitly states the cellular sources remain unknown and are the subject of future study.",
